control: Each body request hands its account's credential over and records the latest authentication attempt when it ends
removes: a body request hands over the credential it started from rather than the one its source holds, so a rotation is never written back
packages: ./mediate
tests: TestEachBodyRequestHandsOverAndRecordsTheAttempt TestARotationWhoseWriteBackFailedIsKept
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes
